<title>SWITZERLAND: Feldschloesschen has 95/96 loss, cuts div.</title>
<headline>Feldschloesschen has 95/96 loss, cuts div.</headline>
<dateline>RHEINFELDEN, Switzerland 1997-02-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swiss brewer Feldschloesschen-Huerlimann Holding AG said it had posted a 113 million Swiss franc loss after restructuring charges in the 1995/1996 business year ended September 30 and would cut its dividend to 15 percent of shares' nominal value from 22 percent.</p>
</text>
